<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:02.400" end="00:00:05.900" style="s2">I&#39;ve never seen one this small.</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.400" end="00:00:07.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure it&#39;s fully grown?</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.900" end="00:00:11.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at him. Of course he isn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.800" end="00:00:11.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Such a strange little face.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.500" end="00:00:17.085" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay away.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.065" end="00:00:17.085" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.600" end="00:00:22.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is he shouting?</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.100" end="00:00:24.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe that&#39;s how they speak.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.500" end="00:00:26.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You brought a human child into our</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.700" end="00:00:30.100" style="s2">valley.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.800" end="00:00:32.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He had nowhere else to go.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.100" end="00:00:35.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you find him?</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.300" end="00:00:35.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Eastern Forest.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.700" end="00:00:45.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where am I?</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.600" end="00:00:49.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re safe.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.000" end="00:00:49.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Safe. Safe. Look at them.</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.800" end="00:00:52.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see them.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.100" end="00:00:57.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re monsters.</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.700" end="00:01:02.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.600" end="00:01:04.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean yes?</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.880" end="00:01:04.900" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.800" end="00:01:09.000" style="s2">My father.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.500" end="00:01:11.700" style="s2">Where&#39;s my father? He was right behind</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.000" end="00:01:15.200" style="s2">me. I SAW HIM. WHERE IS HE?</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.700" end="00:01:15.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I DON&#39;T know where he is now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.000" end="00:01:20.900" style="s2">Easy, boy.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.800" end="00:01:23.800" style="s2">Put down the blade.</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.900" end="00:01:23.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STAY AWAY FROM ME.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.600" end="00:01:38.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s happening?</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.700" end="00:01:38.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The stone. LOOK AT THE STONE.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.500" end="00:01:46.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO.</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.300" end="00:01:48.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.400" end="00:01:49.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That stone hasn&#39;t answered anyone in</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.100" end="00:01:52.661" style="s2">generations.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.500" end="00:01:54.681" style="s2">And now a single drop of his blood.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.661" end="00:01:54.681" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.700" end="00:02:05.392" style="s2">The blood.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.492" end="00:02:06.392" style="s2">It still lives.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.392" end="00:02:07.892" style="s2">Uh.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.392" end="00:02:09.892" style="s2">Do you understand what you&#39;ve brought</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.892" end="00:02:12.092" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.892" end="00:02:13.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A frightened boy.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.092" end="00:02:17.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perhaps.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.392" end="00:02:17.492" style="s2">But I fear he&#39;s far more than that.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.092" end="00:02:27.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was that the stone again?</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.192" end="00:02:27.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. That was him.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.292" end="00:02:32.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you hungry?</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.961" end="00:02:34.192" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.992" end="00:02:37.792" style="s2">Come.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.192" end="00:02:37.792" style="s2">Let&#39;s find you something to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.541" end="00:02:57.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.692" end="00:03:13.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COME ON.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.092" end="00:03:20.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IS THAT A HUMAN?</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.892" end="00:03:23.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LOOKS LIKE ONE.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.392" end="00:03:25.072" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is he so small?</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.052" end="00:03:25.072" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.792" end="00:03:29.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop staring.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.592" end="00:03:44.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is that?</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.992" end="00:03:45.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Soup.</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.292" end="00:03:49.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s in it?</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.492" end="00:03:51.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Roots, meat, mushrooms, and I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.892" end="00:03:53.692" style="s2">know.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.192" end="00:03:53.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t know?</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.092" end="00:03:58.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Taste good.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.792" end="00:04:03.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are these safe to eat?</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.487" end="00:04:15.507" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.694" end="00:04:20.094" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.994" end="00:04:20.094" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.692" end="00:04:22.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.194" end="00:04:32.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can sleep here.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.694" end="00:04:36.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where will you sleep?</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.294" end="00:04:36.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over there.</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.794" end="00:04:42.494" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.294" end="00:04:47.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you going to lock me in?</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.494" end="00:04:49.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.394" end="00:05:00.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I can leave?</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.194" end="00:05:03.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When you&#39;re strong enough to travel,</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.194" end="00:05:05.594" style="s2">we&#39;ll talk about where you want to go.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.194" end="00:05:08.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to find my father.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.594" end="00:05:08.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.494" end="00:05:16.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father, no.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.094" end="00:05:16.694" style="s2">Father, IT&#39;S ME. WHAT&#39;S WRONG WITH YOU?</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.394" end="00:05:22.694" style="s2">FATHER?</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.794" end="00:05:27.558" style="s2">NO!</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.538" end="00:05:27.558" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.494" end="00:05:36.194" style="s2">He&#39;d never hurt me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.794" end="00:05:36.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then hold on to that.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.394" end="00:05:40.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you still be here when I wake up?</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.394" end="00:05:42.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.494" end="00:05:45.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Promise?</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.294" end="00:05:45.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.795" end="00:06:10.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve roused me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.395" end="00:06:15.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You weren&#39;t asleep.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.895" end="00:06:17.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was trying.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.595" end="00:06:19.095" style="s2">They&#39;re already here.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.595" end="00:06:20.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who?</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.095" end="00:06:23.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.595" end="00:06:26.895" style="s2">Try not to be late today.</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.895" end="00:06:26.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When have I ever been late?</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.695" end="00:06:30.995" style="s2">Uh,</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.395" end="00:06:30.995" style="s2">last year?</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.995" end="00:06:37.895" style="s2">Okay, last month.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.095" end="00:06:54.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m heading out.</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.344" end="00:06:54.095" style="s2">[music] In best hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.549" end="00:07:00.569" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.134" end="00:07:05.154" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.895" end="00:07:20.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no need for this.</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.295" end="00:07:21.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, little one.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.495" end="00:07:22.295" style="s2">There you are.</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.195" end="00:07:24.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan,</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.295" end="00:07:26.395" style="s2">how many times have I told you?</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.495" end="00:07:29.195" style="s2">You can&#39;t just change form whenever you</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.395" end="00:07:29.195" style="s2">feel like it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.895" end="00:07:51.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too thin.</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.895" end="00:07:54.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said that last year.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.395" end="00:07:54.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were thin last year, too.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.595" end="00:08:00.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Four silvers. Three.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.595" end="00:08:02.195" style="s2">Four. You sold it for two last year. It</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.795" end="00:08:03.495" style="s2">didn&#39;t rain last year.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.195" end="00:08:05.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the rain got to do with your</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.495" end="00:08:06.595" style="s2">wares?</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.695" end="00:08:07.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.595" end="00:08:09.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why four?</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.897" end="00:08:11.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I want four.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.945" end="00:08:11.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.297" end="00:08:16.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three and A HALF.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.497" end="00:08:16.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DEAL.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.045" end="00:08:25.065" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.197" end="00:08:28.297" style="s2">LOOKS LIKE WE WON&#39;T BE LATE TODAY.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.420" end="00:08:41.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.897" end="00:08:42.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT EXACTLY ARE WE MEANT TO BE</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.897" end="00:08:44.397" style="s2">CATCHING?</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.797" end="00:08:45.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Best not to ask.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.397" end="00:08:47.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the thing eats me, I ought to at</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.697" end="00:08:49.897" style="s2">least know its name.</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.397" end="00:08:53.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It will not eat you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.897" end="00:08:53.397" style="s2">It will trample you first.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.097" end="00:09:10.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We enter through the third boundary.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.897" end="00:09:12.597" style="s2">There is an old hunting trail here.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.597" end="00:09:14.897" style="s2">Infantry to the front. Crossbowmen keep</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.597" end="00:09:16.097" style="s2">60 paces behind. No pursuit without my</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.897" end="00:09:18.797" style="s2">command.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.097" end="00:09:20.797" style="s2">And if we encounter them in numbers?</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.797" end="00:09:22.997" style="s2">Fall back to open ground.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.797" end="00:09:24.997" style="s2">How many counters numbers?</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.997" end="00:09:28.297" style="s2">More than one.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.997" end="00:09:28.297" style="s2">Do not mistake them for beasts.</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.497" end="00:09:32.097" style="s2">The commander of the kingdom&#39;s monster</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.097" end="00:09:33.797" style="s2">hunters</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.097" end="00:09:36.097" style="s2">warning his own men not to mistake</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.797" end="00:09:37.997" style="s2">demons for beasts. Beasts flee. These</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.097" end="00:09:39.497" style="s2">things come back for you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.997" end="00:09:42.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which is why I am here.</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.497" end="00:09:44.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which is why we brought 200 more men.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.097" end="00:09:46.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is Talus still the target?</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.197" end="00:09:48.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alive.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.697" end="00:09:50.597" style="s2">The original order permitted us to kill</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.297" end="00:09:52.897" style="s2">it. The order has changed.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.597" end="00:09:52.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When?</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.797" end="00:09:57.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last night.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.797" end="00:10:07.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Recovered alive and intact?</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.997" end="00:10:10.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.197" end="00:10:12.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A 3 m long monster.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.398" end="00:10:12.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.998" end="00:10:20.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dragged through 20 miles of forest.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.498" end="00:10:22.098" style="s2">My men are not corpse haulers.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.398" end="00:10:24.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.098" end="00:10:26.298" style="s2">A corpse has no value.</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.898" end="00:10:28.198" style="s2">What in hell are you taking from these</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.298" end="00:10:29.898" style="s2">things?</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.198" end="00:10:33.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something that keeps the fires burning</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.898" end="00:10:33.198" style="s2">in your city through winter.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.012" end="00:10:38.032" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.112" end="00:10:54.298" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.098" end="00:10:54.298" style="s2">That thing is coming with us.</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.298" end="00:10:58.798" style="s2">Let us hope we have no need of it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.098" end="00:11:09.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are there so many people this time?</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.498" end="00:11:11.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They came to watch you embarrass</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.198" end="00:11:13.398" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.698" end="00:11:16.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well then,</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.398" end="00:11:16.498" style="s2">I&#39;d better give them a show.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.498" end="00:11:27.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T SMASH THIS.</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.447" end="00:11:30.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.698" end="00:11:33.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CAREFUL. HE MIGHT TRANSFORM AND</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.098" end="00:11:33.198" style="s2">OVERPOWER YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.272" end="00:11:39.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.198" end="00:11:42.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DO NOT WORRY.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.998" end="00:11:44.898" style="s2">I&#39;LL BE GENTLE.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.398" end="00:11:44.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d better.</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.098" end="00:11:50.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is only one question we want</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.298" end="00:11:54.198" style="s2">answered.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.698" end="00:11:56.698" style="s2">How strong is he now? No weapons,</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.198" end="00:11:59.198" style="s2">no transformations.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.698" end="00:12:00.498" style="s2">Get ready. Three,</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.198" end="00:12:01.498" style="s2">TWO,</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.498" end="00:12:03.698" style="s2">ONE.</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.498" end="00:12:03.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BEGIN.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.198" end="00:12:12.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THIS IS WHAT YOU CALL GOING EASY ON ME?</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.398" end="00:12:27.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.048" end="00:12:47.068" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.349" end="00:13:26.369" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.789" end="00:13:57.809" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.301" end="00:14:16.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DO NOT LOOK.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.601" end="00:14:19.401" style="s2">WHY?</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.401" end="00:14:19.401" style="s2">You will know soon enough.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.601" end="00:14:24.701" style="s2">Pass the word.</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.201" end="00:14:27.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.701" end="00:14:31.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once we enter the forest, no one leaves</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.001" end="00:14:31.001" style="s2">another man&#39;s sight. Understood?</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.601" end="00:14:35.701" style="s2">If we come upon anything that does not</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.101" end="00:14:38.801" style="s2">attack us,</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.701" end="00:14:38.801" style="s2">do not strike first.</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.701" end="00:14:42.901" style="s2">And the necromancer&#39;s orders are</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.101" end="00:14:47.590" style="s2">Whose command do you follow?</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.570" end="00:14:47.590" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.201" end="00:14:51.601" style="s2">Yours.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.701" end="00:14:56.601" style="s2">Then remember it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.101" end="00:15:18.320" style="s2">So long as whatever dwells in that</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.701" end="00:15:18.901" style="s2">forest knows how to cooperate,</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.320" end="00:15:22.501" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.901" end="00:15:22.501" style="s2">it will not need to feed today.</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.800" end="00:15:33.101" style="s2">[music] Well, not bad, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.501" end="00:15:37.601" style="s2">You have a long way to go.</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.101" end="00:15:37.601" style="s2">You&#39;ll be a master when you can beat me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.601" end="00:16:21.502" style="s2">It remembers you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.802" end="00:16:22.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It remembers everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.502" end="00:16:24.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:16:22.802" end="00:16:27.602" style="s2">It remembers only those worth</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.702" end="00:16:27.602" style="s2">remembering.</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.302" end="00:16:36.402" style="s2">Why did you change today?</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.202" end="00:16:39.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because it&#39;s faster than walking.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.402" end="00:16:42.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t asking why you leaped.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.902" end="00:16:42.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.802" end="00:16:47.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are too many eyes in the city on</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.702" end="00:16:49.802" style="s2">Homecoming Day.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.002" end="00:16:52.802" style="s2">Eyes that do not belong here.</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.802" end="00:16:56.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They know about the firstborn.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.802" end="00:16:56.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They know the legends.</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.002" end="00:17:03.402" style="s2">The people here would never harm you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.602" end="00:17:06.302" style="s2">But no one knows where every pair of</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.402" end="00:17:08.302" style="s2">eyes in this city came from today.</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.302" end="00:17:11.502" style="s2">The resonance of the firstborn is more</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.302" end="00:17:13.602" style="s2">than merely changing your skin.</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.502" end="00:17:16.102" style="s2">Every time you unleash it,</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.602" end="00:17:17.602" style="s2">the old veins can hear you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.102" end="00:17:19.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The old veins?</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.602" end="00:17:21.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The mountains can hear you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.602" end="00:17:22.702" style="s2">The things that sleep beneath them can</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.402" end="00:17:24.502" style="s2">hear you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.702" end="00:17:26.202" style="s2">And some who should never know you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.502" end="00:17:28.802" style="s2">alive</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.202" end="00:17:31.902" style="s2">may hear you as well.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.802" end="00:17:31.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never told me that before.</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.002" end="00:17:35.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before,</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.502" end="00:17:38.002" style="s2">you weren&#39;t using it as a shortcut down</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.402" end="00:17:38.002" style="s2">the mountain.</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.502" end="00:17:40.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.502" end="00:17:42.802" style="s2">I promise. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.702" end="00:17:45.702" style="s2">I&#39;ll try not to change unless I have to.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.802" end="00:17:45.702" style="s2">At least not on the way down.</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.102" end="00:18:00.302" style="s2">Another year</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.502" end="00:18:02.802" style="s2">you have returned from the snow peaks,</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.302" end="00:18:04.702" style="s2">returned from the wetlands, returned</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.802" end="00:18:06.802" style="s2">from the underground rivers, from beyond</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.702" end="00:18:09.402" style="s2">the great tree, and from the farthest</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.802" end="00:18:11.302" style="s2">migration grounds.</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.402" end="00:18:12.902" style="s2">We return to learn who still [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.302" end="00:18:16.202" style="s2">lives,</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.902" end="00:18:18.102" style="s2">which roads may still be walked,</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.202" end="00:18:20.803" style="s2">where food is scarce,</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.102" end="00:18:23.087" style="s2">where water is scarce, where medicine is</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.803" end="00:18:23.087" style="s2">scarce. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.703" end="00:18:29.103" style="s2">And also to learn what is drawing near</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.603" end="00:18:31.603" style="s2">to us.</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.103" end="00:18:33.903" style="s2">Those of the mountains bring ore. Those</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.603" end="00:18:36.903" style="s2">of the forests bring seeds. Those who</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.903" end="00:18:39.903" style="s2">fly bring word from far away. We need</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.903" end="00:18:42.203" style="s2">one another. This is the returning.</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.903" end="00:18:44.303" style="s2">Yet long ago we returned [music] for</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.203" end="00:18:47.603" style="s2">another reason as well.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.303" end="00:18:49.203" style="s2">In those days someone awaited us here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.603" end="00:18:49.803" style="s2">All living things that bore the</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.203" end="00:18:52.603" style="s2">resonance [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.803" end="00:18:52.603" style="s2">would return.</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.503" end="00:18:59.403" style="s2">In time the one who waited for us was</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.003" end="00:18:59.403" style="s2">God.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.503" end="00:19:05.703" style="s2">Yet still we return.</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.803" end="00:19:07.503" style="s2">For no matter how far one may wander,</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.703" end="00:19:09.403" style="s2">one must never [music] forget where one</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.503" end="00:19:11.103" style="s2">began.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.403" end="00:19:14.503" style="s2">Welcome home</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.103" end="00:19:14.503" style="s2">all who yet live.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.103" end="00:19:25.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eran.</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.003" end="00:19:28.703" style="s2">Did you see it?</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.403" end="00:19:54.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What horn is that?</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.703" end="00:19:59.373" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The humans have entered.</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.353" end="00:19:59.373" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.603" end="00:20:05.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father, no.</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.203" end="00:20:07.233" style="s2">Father, it&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.213" end="00:20:07.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.903" end="00:20:12.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The eastern third boundary has been</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.203" end="00:20:13.403" style="s2">breached.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.303" end="00:20:16.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many?</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.403" end="00:20:17.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 400 give or take.</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.003" end="00:20:21.203" style="s2">Heavy armor, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.303" end="00:20:24.203" style="s2">heavy crossbows, beast capture wagons,</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.203" end="00:20:24.203" style="s2">and a necromancer.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.403" end="00:20:25.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.605" end="00:20:27.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; did they take? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.705" end="00:20:28.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talu.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.005" end="00:20:31.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which Talu?</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.105" end="00:20:31.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The one from the southern marsh.</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.905" end="00:20:35.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.605" end="00:20:36.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know where I&#39;m going.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.005" end="00:20:38.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.605" end="00:20:39.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They took Talu.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.405" end="00:20:42.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.405" end="00:20:42.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are you still standing here?</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.719" end="00:20:53.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.505" end="00:21:22.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.469" end="00:21:26.489" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.305" end="00:21:33.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not touch it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.305" end="00:21:35.305" style="s2">Necromancer&#39;s iron.</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.605" end="00:21:39.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does it do?</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.305" end="00:21:39.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It keeps your wounds from healing.</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.005" end="00:21:45.505" style="s2">They should be close.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.705" end="00:21:45.505" style="s2">Stay sharp.</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.670" end="00:21:52.690" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.045" end="00:22:09.065" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.805" end="00:22:13.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are they doing to him?</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.605" end="00:22:16.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Draining his essence.</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.905" end="00:22:18.505" style="s2">It is far more painful than drawing</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.005" end="00:22:18.505" style="s2">blood.</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.205" end="00:22:27.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much longer?</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.405" end="00:22:28.506" style="s2">It is resisting.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.406" end="00:22:30.006" style="s2">So.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.506" end="00:22:31.706" style="s2">So it is valuable.</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.006" end="00:22:35.406" style="s2">That is not what I asked.</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.706" end="00:22:38.406" style="s2">Finish extracting it then we leave.</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.406" end="00:22:38.406" style="s2">It is too quiet here.</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.406" end="00:22:43.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look.</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.906" end="00:23:02.506" style="s2">Don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.506" end="00:23:20.206" style="s2">Hold steady.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.406" end="00:23:48.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SECOND RANK, CLOSE.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.306" end="00:23:56.506" style="s2">HEAVY CROSSBOWS.</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.307" end="00:24:40.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; VISCH,</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.408" end="00:24:40.707" style="s2">WHERE THE HELL HAVE YOU BEEN?</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.307" end="00:24:53.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP!</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.507" end="00:24:53.908" style="s2">HUMAN?</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.707" end="00:25:01.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RYAN, GO NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.207" end="00:25:05.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHY? We won.</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.507" end="00:25:08.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because it&#39;s coming.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.607" end="00:25:17.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WATCH OUT!</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.908" end="00:25:25.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NOW THE REAL HUNT BEGINS.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.167" end="00:25:28.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.707" end="00:25:30.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU MEAN THIS DRAGON?</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.107" end="00:25:32.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOVE. We can&#39;t fight it. Fall back and</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.807" end="00:25:35.707" style="s2">gather more men.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.007" end="00:25:35.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re just leaving. Talu is still here.</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.107" end="00:25:46.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kill those creatures and the human.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.908" end="00:25:46.807" style="s2">Then take Talu.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.707" end="00:26:03.307" style="s2">Trust me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.507" end="00:26:06.107" style="s2">This time.</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.107" end="00:26:31.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.458" end="00:26:47.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.809" end="00:26:50.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT&#39;S WRONG WITH YOU? KEEP BREATHING</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.409" end="00:26:50.209" style="s2">FIRE.</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.309" end="00:27:10.409" style="s2">A PRIMORDIAL.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.709" end="00:27:15.509" style="s2">You</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.109" end="00:27:15.509" style="s2">you&#39;re still alive.</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.828" end="00:27:20.848" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.009" end="00:27:34.809" style="s2">It spoke to you. It asked if we were</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.809" end="00:27:36.309" style="s2">still alive.</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.809" end="00:27:38.409" style="s2">Primordial,</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.309" end="00:27:41.009" style="s2">beware of this</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.409" end="00:27:43.009" style="s2">until we meet again.</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.009" end="00:27:45.009" style="s2">Take Talu back. We need to leave this</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.009" end="00:27:47.809" style="s2">place first. That necromancer is still</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.009" end="00:27:47.809" style="s2">nearby.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.909" end="00:28:15.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have found the primordial resonant. He</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.309" end="00:28:17.709" style="s2">can resist Necromancer&#39;s iron.</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.109" end="00:28:18.809" style="s2">And the war dragon responded to him of</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.709" end="00:28:21.409" style="s2">its own accord.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.809" end="00:28:23.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Location.</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.409" end="00:28:25.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eastern third boundary.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.509" end="00:28:28.109" style="s2">He lives among the creatures.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.209" end="00:28:28.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come back.</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.014" end="00:28:45.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.710" end="00:28:47.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can start now.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.410" end="00:28:49.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.210" end="00:28:51.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Insult me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.210" end="00:28:52.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am trying to decide which thing to</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.110" end="00:28:56.110" style="s2">start with.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.810" end="00:28:56.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we may be here a while.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.110" end="00:29:00.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It saw you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.310" end="00:29:02.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.510" end="00:29:06.410" style="s2">But the dragon is not our enemy.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.410" end="00:29:08.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. But others saw you too.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.410" end="00:29:11.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean the necromancer?</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.610" end="00:29:13.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Far more than that.</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.310" end="00:29:15.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saved someone.</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.210" end="00:29:17.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But saving one man and letting the whole</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.410" end="00:29:19.910" style="s2">world know you have returned are two</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.610" end="00:29:21.210" style="s2">very different things.</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.910" end="00:29:23.010" style="s2">Today</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.210" end="00:29:25.210" style="s2">you did both.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.010" end="00:29:26.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That dragon knew the primordial</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.210" end="00:29:28.110" style="s2">and it&#39;s being forced to serve the</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.410" end="00:29:30.410" style="s2">humans.</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.110" end="00:29:33.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are many things forced to serve</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.410" end="00:29:33.110" style="s2">humans.</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.310" end="00:29:36.510" style="s2">Come.</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.510" end="00:29:40.210" style="s2">It is nearly time.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.510" end="00:29:40.210" style="s2">The elders have called for us.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.510" end="00:29:47.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The humans did not venture any farther.</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.810" end="00:29:47.610" style="s2">They have withdrawn.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.710" end="00:29:54.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They saw him.</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.210" end="00:29:54.710" style="s2">How many?</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.810" end="00:30:02.210" style="s2">Maybe [music] two. Maybe three.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.210" end="00:30:02.210" style="s2">Oh, right. There was a dragon too.</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.410" end="00:30:10.410" style="s2">Did it respond to you?</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.410" end="00:30:13.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.410" end="00:30:14.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did it say?</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.410" end="00:30:18.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It asked,</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.910" end="00:30:21.110" style="s2">are you still alive? And then</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.110" end="00:30:21.110" style="s2">until we meet again.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.210" end="00:30:25.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are they taking Tallu?</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.410" end="00:30:28.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To a human city.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.110" end="00:30:30.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those bastards&#39; lands are getting closer</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.910" end="00:30:34.510" style="s2">and closer to ours. They&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.810" end="00:30:34.510" style="s2">expanding for years.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.810" end="00:30:40.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why has no one told me any of this?</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.212" end="00:30:45.112" style="s2">And what would you have done if we had?</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.112" end="00:30:47.912" style="s2">Run into a human city, tell them to</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.112" end="00:30:47.912" style="s2">release Talu.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.812" end="00:30:52.312" style="s2">You would.</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.612" end="00:31:07.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At last.</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.612" end="00:31:09.912" style="s2">After hundreds of years.</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.612" end="00:31:13.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.912" end="00:31:13.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The old well has sounded.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.212" end="00:31:26.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lord.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.912" end="00:31:28.312" style="s2">I heard it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.912" end="00:31:30.612" style="s2">How many?</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.312" end="00:31:30.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two.</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.912" end="00:31:34.812" style="s2">They&#39;ve returned.</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.936" end="00:31:37.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.912" end="00:31:39.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lord.</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.312" end="00:31:40.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Summon the royal council.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.212" end="00:31:41.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now?</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.112" end="00:31:43.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now.</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.712" end="00:31:45.712" style="s2">And inform Dragon Hold.</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.912" end="00:31:47.112" style="s2">All adult war dragons are to be placed</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.712" end="00:31:49.012" style="s2">on alert.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.112" end="00:31:50.212" style="s2">Bring the great purge forward.</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.012" end="00:31:50.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was scheduled for another three</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.212" end="00:31:52.012" style="s2">months.</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.912" end="00:31:55.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.012" end="00:31:55.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my lord. I&#39;ll inform them at once.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.812" end="00:32:06.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.112" end="00:32:09.212" style="s2">I will make certain you disappear</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.412" end="00:32:12.412" style="s2">completely.</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.212" end="00:32:13.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve made up your mind.</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.412" end="00:32:15.312" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.412" end="00:32:16.712" style="s2">I&#39;m going.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.312" end="00:32:18.112" style="s2">They already know the primordial has</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.712" end="00:32:20.012" style="s2">returned. If I stay here, I&#39;m only</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.112" end="00:32:22.012" style="s2">bringing the war back to them.</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.012" end="00:32:25.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think going to the human kingdom</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.012" end="00:32:25.412" style="s2">will keep the war away?</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.337" end="00:32:31.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.112" end="00:32:34.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least I&#39;ll know what they want.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.212" end="00:32:37.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t even know why you nearly died</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.012" end="00:32:37.212" style="s2">12 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.402" end="00:32:46.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.613" end="00:32:46.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this?</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.813" end="00:32:49.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.813" end="00:32:57.113" style="s2">That night after I took you away,</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.713" end="00:32:58.613" style="s2">I went back.</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.113" end="00:32:59.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw him?</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.613" end="00:33:02.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.813" end="00:33:04.913" style="s2">Only blood and axe</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.413" end="00:33:07.213" style="s2">and this.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.913" end="00:33:09.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you only giving it to me now?</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.213" end="00:33:12.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because if I had given it to you before,</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.713" end="00:33:15.413" style="s2">you would have gone back.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.813" end="00:33:18.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you think I won&#39;t now?</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.413" end="00:33:22.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least now, if you go back,</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.613" end="00:33:22.813" style="s2">you won&#39;t die the moment you arrive.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.713" end="00:33:29.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you think he&#39;s still alive?</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.613" end="00:33:31.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know. But when you return, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.313" end="00:33:33.913" style="s2">believe everything written in stone</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.813" end="00:33:36.513" style="s2">and don&#39;t trust anyone dressed in fine</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.913" end="00:33:36.513" style="s2">clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.913" end="00:33:42.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything else?</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.213" end="00:33:42.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t transform.</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.313" end="00:33:46.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew you&#39;d say that.</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.713" end="00:33:51.813" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.713" end="00:33:51.813" style="s2">I&#39;ll find the answers.</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.613" end="00:33:56.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan,</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.413" end="00:33:57.513" style="s2">if you find that place is no longer your</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.313" end="00:34:01.113" style="s2">home,</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.513" end="00:34:01.113" style="s2">don&#39;t force yourself to stay.</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.913" end="00:34:04.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is my home.</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.553" end="00:34:09.573" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.913" end="00:34:42.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.913" end="00:34:47.614" style="s2">They tell me haven&#39; spoken a word of</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.614" end="00:34:50.128" style="s2">your own pair in a year.</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.614" end="00:34:51.414" style="s2">I remember when you weren&#39;t like this.</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.128" end="00:34:53.314" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.414" end="00:34:55.314" style="s2">For the first year you asked every day</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.314" end="00:34:56.914" style="s2">when they&#39;d let you out.</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.314" end="00:34:58.914" style="s2">By the third year you were begging them</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.914" end="00:35:02.914" style="s2">to kill you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.914" end="00:35:02.914" style="s2">Eventually you stopped asking even that.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.614" end="00:35:07.614" style="s2">The Eastern Expeditionary Forces</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.214" end="00:35:10.514" style="s2">returned.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.614" end="00:35:12.114" style="s2">Few of them made it back alive.</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.514" end="00:35:14.414" style="s2">They failed to bring back the quarry</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.114" end="00:35:17.714" style="s2">they were sent to hunt.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.414" end="00:35:20.614" style="s2">But they brought back news.</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.714" end="00:35:23.114" style="s2">I found your son.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.614" end="00:35:23.114" style="s2">Ryan.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.314" end="00:35:31.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.814" end="00:35:35.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s alive.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.114" end="00:35:41.714" style="s2">He&#39;s a grown man now.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.114" end="00:35:42.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.714" end="00:35:44.414" style="s2">You&#39;re lying.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.714" end="00:35:47.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.414" end="00:35:47.514" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to believe me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.614" end="00:35:53.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You you have him.</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.354" end="00:35:55.414" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.914" end="00:35:56.414" style="s2">Don&#39;t look for him.</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.414" end="00:35:59.314" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.414" end="00:35:59.314" style="s2">Don&#39;t go after him.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.614" end="00:36:05.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you do remember how to beg.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.414" end="00:36:07.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He knows nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.414" end="00:36:09.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 16 years ago I thought he knew nothing</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.514" end="00:36:09.814" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.614" end="00:36:16.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morgan, I&#39;ll do anything you ask. JUST</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.014" end="00:36:18.514" style="s2">DON&#39;T TOUCH HIM.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.714" end="00:36:19.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU&#39;LL BE OF USE TO ME.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.514" end="00:36:21.114" style="s2">I promise you that.</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.814" end="00:36:22.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE IS HE? TELL [screaming] ME WHERE</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.114" end="00:36:25.014" style="s2">HE IS.</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.814" end="00:36:25.014" style="s2">RYAN.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.916" end="00:36:53.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT&#39;S THEM.</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.616" end="00:36:53.816" style="s2">THEY WERE HERE HALF A DAY AGO.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.316" end="00:37:08.916" style="s2">Please</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.316" end="00:37:08.916" style="s2">don&#39;t kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.216" end="00:37:17.216" style="s2">A human.</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.016" end="00:37:17.216" style="s2">You came out of the forest?</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.416" end="00:37:22.316" style="s2">The road&#39;s that way.</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.916" end="00:37:27.316" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.416" end="00:38:10.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It still will not heal.</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.016" end="00:38:12.216" style="s2">The other wounds are healing,</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.016" end="00:38:15.116" style="s2">but not this one.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.216" end="00:38:16.516" style="s2">No crossbow bolt made this wound.</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.116" end="00:38:18.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A blade.</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.516" end="00:38:20.216" style="s2">The man in black robes.</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.416" end="00:38:23.516" style="s2">When we found Taru, he had a knife in</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.216" end="00:38:25.816" style="s2">his hand. He was cutting into its back.</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.516" end="00:38:28.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Necromantic iron.</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.816" end="00:38:30.016" style="s2">But it looked like an ordinary knife, so</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.316" end="00:38:32.216" style="s2">it seemed.</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.016" end="00:38:34.716" style="s2">An ordinary blade would leave no such</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.216" end="00:38:34.716" style="s2">mark.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.016" end="00:38:39.416" style="s2">They have learned to forge necromantic</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.916" end="00:38:41.916" style="s2">iron into blades this thin, and the</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.416" end="00:38:44.216" style="s2">wounds are harder to heal than ever.</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.916" end="00:38:47.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First came the heavy crossbows, then</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.216" end="00:38:47.116" style="s2">came the chains.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.896" end="00:38:51.417" style="s2">[music] Now even small knife can do this</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.717" end="00:38:53.417" style="s2">to us.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.417" end="00:38:56.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The necromantic iron of men grows</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.417" end="00:38:58.117" style="s2">deadlier with each passing year.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.217" end="00:39:00.717" style="s2">In the last battle at the border, we</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.117" end="00:39:02.217" style="s2">could still recognize their weapons.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.717" end="00:39:04.417" style="s2">Now you may not even know what has</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.217" end="00:39:07.117" style="s2">wounded you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.417" end="00:39:09.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We cannot go on like this.</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.117" end="00:39:12.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What would you have us do?</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.317" end="00:39:13.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Men bring their weapons into our forest.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.317" end="00:39:14.917" style="s2">Why should we not venture into their</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.817" end="00:39:17.817" style="s2">lands?</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.917" end="00:39:19.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They have walls, armies, and that</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.817" end="00:39:20.417" style="s2">dragon.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.017" end="00:39:23.117" style="s2">How many of our own would you send</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.417" end="00:39:23.117" style="s2">against them?</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.517" end="00:39:27.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is Ryan?</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.197" end="00:39:30.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.817" end="00:39:33.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have not seen him since morning.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.817" end="00:39:33.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He has gone.</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.717" end="00:39:41.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where?</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.517" end="00:39:43.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To the cities of men.</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.217" end="00:39:45.817" style="s2">Alone.</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.317" end="00:39:45.817" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.417" end="00:39:50.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it not too dangerous for him to go</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.017" end="00:39:53.017" style="s2">there now?</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.717" end="00:39:56.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.017" end="00:39:58.817" style="s2">That is why he must go.</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.017" end="00:40:00.317" style="s2">Do not place all our hopes upon Ryan.</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.817" end="00:40:03.017" style="s2">There is much to be done before he</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.317" end="00:40:03.017" style="s2">returns.</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.217" end="00:40:23.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, there&#39;s someone over there.</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.617" end="00:40:29.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get inside the city before nightfall.</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.017" end="00:40:32.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.417" end="00:40:40.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More than 400 men.</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.817" end="00:40:42.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We took more than 400 men out there.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.517" end="00:40:44.517" style="s2">Less than half came back alive.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.917" end="00:40:47.217" style="s2">Some of their bodies are still lying out</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.517" end="00:40:47.217" style="s2">in the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.617" end="00:40:51.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; War always costs lives.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.718" end="00:40:55.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.718" end="00:41:04.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said this wasn&#39;t our first expedition.</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.918" end="00:41:05.818" style="s2">You should know that better than anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.318" end="00:41:08.318" style="s2">The very talu you ordered us to bring</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.818" end="00:41:09.718" style="s2">back alive was rescued by them.</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.318" end="00:41:11.518" style="s2">We lost most of our force for those</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.718" end="00:41:14.418" style="s2">creatures. A failed mission means</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.518" end="00:41:16.218" style="s2">someone must answer for it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.418" end="00:41:17.418" style="s2">You intend to lay this failure at my</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.218" end="00:41:19.518" style="s2">feet.</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.418" end="00:41:21.838" style="s2">You were the one who split the force.</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.518" end="00:41:23.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I hadn&#39;t split our forces, WE&#39;D</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.838" end="00:41:24.418" style="s2">[snorts] HAVE BEEN WIPED OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.218" end="00:41:27.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CALDER,</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.418" end="00:41:30.118" style="s2">let go of me or in 3 seconds you&#39;ll be a</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.018" end="00:41:30.118" style="s2">one-armed general.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.648" end="00:41:34.318" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.958" end="00:41:36.918" style="s2">[gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.318" end="00:41:39.118" style="s2">Now that&#39;s more like a commander.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.918" end="00:41:41.518" style="s2">Whose orders were you really following?</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.118" end="00:41:43.418" style="s2">And that dragon, why did it stop obeying</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.518" end="00:41:44.718" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.418" end="00:41:45.618" style="s2">Did you get a good look at that man&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.718" end="00:41:47.518" style="s2">face?</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.618" end="00:41:50.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m asking about the dragon.</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.518" end="00:41:53.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I&#39;m asking about the man.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.018" end="00:41:53.618" style="s2">He&#39;s far more important than talu.</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.518" end="00:41:59.118" style="s2">He saved those creatures</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.518" end="00:42:01.718" style="s2">and he didn&#39;t pursue our wounded when we</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.118" end="00:42:04.718" style="s2">retreated.</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.718" end="00:42:04.718" style="s2">Why do you want him?</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.718" end="00:42:10.118" style="s2">You&#39;re not entitled to know everything.</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.618" end="00:42:11.418" style="s2">I need you to have the travel records</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.118" end="00:42:13.918" style="s2">from every city in the eastern</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.418" end="00:42:15.618" style="s2">territories sent to the capital,</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.918" end="00:42:17.618" style="s2">especially anyone who came out of the</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.618" end="00:42:19.818" style="s2">forest alone.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.618" end="00:42:22.318" style="s2">Things are about to change,</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.818" end="00:42:22.318" style="s2">commander.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.118" end="00:42:30.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Halt.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.318" end="00:42:34.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you from?</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.618" end="00:42:37.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The west.</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.918" end="00:42:41.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s nothing west but forest.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.518" end="00:42:45.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A hunter from the frontier.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.319" end="00:42:49.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.318" end="00:42:50.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something like that.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.618" end="00:42:53.420" style="s2">They&#39;re checking everyone at the</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.520" end="00:42:53.420" style="s2">crossroads ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.320" end="00:43:00.020" style="s2">Keep your blade out of sight.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.520" end="00:43:00.020" style="s2">The guards are in a foul mood today.</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.320" end="00:43:03.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.520" end="00:43:06.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The army&#39;s returned.</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.620" end="00:43:10.620" style="s2">Fewer men came back alive than went out.</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.520" end="00:43:10.620" style="s2">Anything can happen in the Demon Forest.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.720" end="00:43:14.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been there?</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.420" end="00:43:14.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nope.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.920" end="00:43:18.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then how would you know?</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.820" end="00:43:20.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, that&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.820" end="00:43:22.720" style="s2">Come with me. I&#39;ll take you into the</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.320" end="00:43:22.720" style="s2">city.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.964" end="00:43:26.984" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.720" end="00:43:34.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.320" end="00:43:37.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Think nothing of it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.020" end="00:43:38.320" style="s2">I&#39;m a merchant. Name&#39;s Edric Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.120" end="00:43:39.520" style="s2">And you?</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.320" end="00:43:41.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.520" end="00:43:43.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. You look new to the city.</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.720" end="00:43:47.320" style="s2">Need a hand finding some work?</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.820" end="00:43:47.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;ve got business to take care of.</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.320" end="00:43:51.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Goodwill is good for business.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.220" end="00:43:54.120" style="s2">If there&#39;s anything else you need help</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.420" end="00:43:56.420" style="s2">with, come find me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.120" end="00:43:56.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.300" end="00:44:04.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.620" end="00:44:08.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My cousin saw it. A dragon. The whole</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.820" end="00:44:09.720" style="s2">sky turned red.</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.320" end="00:44:10.815" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last month you said you&#39;d seen two of</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.720" end="00:44:11.520" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.815" end="00:44:15.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.520" end="00:44:15.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time a lot of people really died.</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.720" end="00:44:21.920" style="s2">All those men.</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.220" end="00:44:24.620" style="s2">And they came back with nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.920" end="00:44:24.620" style="s2">It was rescued.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.820" end="00:44:28.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who rescued it?</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.535" end="00:44:30.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.500" end="00:44:32.320" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.020" end="00:44:34.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw a man.</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.320" end="00:44:36.320" style="s2">He was standing among those creatures.</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.920" end="00:44:38.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A traitor?</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.320" end="00:44:39.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A traitor.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.020" end="00:44:41.120" style="s2">I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.820" end="00:44:43.920" style="s2">That huge white creature could have</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.120" end="00:44:47.420" style="s2">crushed me under its foot.</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.920" end="00:44:47.420" style="s2">But when it saw me, it just walked away.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.720" end="00:44:50.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re just shaken up.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.421" end="00:44:55.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe.</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.721" end="00:45:11.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your stew has gone cold.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.821" end="00:45:13.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.721" end="00:45:15.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why aren&#39;t you eating?</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.121" end="00:45:17.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It tastes dreadful.</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.121" end="00:45:18.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the finest tavern in the city.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.321" end="00:45:20.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then the trouble is greater than I</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.421" end="00:45:20.821" style="s2">thought.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.121" end="00:45:27.021" style="s2">You&#39;re not from around here.</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.621" end="00:45:28.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it you wish to ask?</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.021" end="00:45:30.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Names first.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.421" end="00:45:30.821" style="s2">Eileen.</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.921" end="00:45:34.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.821" end="00:45:37.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The city gate records arrived at the</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.221" end="00:45:37.421" style="s2">archives this afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.221" end="00:45:49.021" style="s2">If I meant to have you arrested, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.021" end="00:45:50.221" style="s2">I would not have come alone.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.021" end="00:45:53.721" style="s2">You&#39;ve been listening to tales of the</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.221" end="00:45:57.221" style="s2">Eastern Marches all evening. So have I.</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.721" end="00:45:57.221" style="s2">Tell me, what do you see?</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.221" end="00:46:02.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why should I answer you?</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.321" end="00:46:06.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 16 years ago there was what they called</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.821" end="00:46:06.421" style="s2">a demon attack. Here.</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.121" end="00:46:13.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.221" end="00:46:15.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; According to the official records, the</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.621" end="00:46:16.721" style="s2">entire village was destroyed in a single</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.221" end="00:46:18.221" style="s2">night. But I found something in the</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.721" end="00:46:19.521" style="s2">military archives.</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.221" end="00:46:23.021" style="s2">The Royal Cavalry had arrived in the</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.521" end="00:46:23.021" style="s2">area two days before the attack.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.621" end="00:46:29.421" style="s2">Do you know that village?</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.821" end="00:46:33.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.262" end="00:46:36.282" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.521" end="00:46:49.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan,</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.021" end="00:46:51.921" style="s2">I did not mean to frighten you with any</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.421" end="00:46:51.921" style="s2">of this.</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.821" end="00:46:58.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why were you looking into a village</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.121" end="00:46:59.723" style="s2">destroyed 16 years ago?</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.223" end="00:47:03.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because every name on the list of the</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.723" end="00:47:07.122" style="s2">dead is missing a record of the body.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.622" end="00:47:09.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The soldiers never found the bodies.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.122" end="00:47:11.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The records claim they were all burnt.</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.523" end="00:47:13.723" style="s2">Yet there isn&#39;t a single record of the</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.023" end="00:47:13.723" style="s2">cremations.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.622" end="00:47:18.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was born there.</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.023" end="00:47:23.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just as I thought. What happened that</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.523" end="00:47:23.823" style="s2">night?</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.122" end="00:47:28.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father tried to kill me,</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.023" end="00:47:31.023" style="s2">so I ran.</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.323" end="00:47:33.922" style="s2">I haven&#39;t been back in 16 years.</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.023" end="00:47:33.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What was your father&#39;s name?</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.023" end="00:47:36.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Holt.</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.922" end="00:47:45.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know that name.</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.523" end="00:47:45.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve seen it before.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.622" end="00:47:48.523" style="s2">On the list of the dead.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.422" end="00:47:51.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And his body.</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.553" end="00:47:55.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.922" end="00:47:55.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As I said, there is no record of it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.023" end="00:48:02.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take me to the archives.</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.323" end="00:48:09.922" style="s2">What is that?</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.422" end="00:48:16.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was issued today. All original</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.323" end="00:48:17.523" style="s2">records of the Eastern Margins incident</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.122" end="00:48:19.523" style="s2">16 years ago are to be sent to the</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.523" end="00:48:20.922" style="s2">capital by morning.</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.523" end="00:48:22.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.922" end="00:48:24.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know, but I have the right to</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.622" end="00:48:26.323" style="s2">examine these records.</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.723" end="00:48:29.122" style="s2">If you wish to learn the truth, this may</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.323" end="00:48:29.122" style="s2">be our only chance.</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.223" end="00:48:37.223" style="s2">How long has it been since you last read</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.622" end="00:48:38.922" style="s2">the Kingdom&#39;s Tongue?</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.223" end="00:48:41.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 16 years.</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.922" end="00:48:44.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you can still read these words?</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.122" end="00:48:44.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t forgotten every word.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.523" end="00:48:47.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here.</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.523" end="00:48:58.224" style="s2">The year 731.</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.922" end="00:49:00.724" style="s2">The register of those involved in the</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.224" end="00:49:00.724" style="s2">incident.</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.024" end="00:49:07.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is the ink darker here?</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.924" end="00:49:20.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Transferred by order of the Crown.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.924" end="00:49:20.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does that mean?</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.924" end="00:49:23.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This designation is reserved for the</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.524" end="00:49:25.024" style="s2">living.</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.524" end="00:49:26.724" style="s2">Whoever bears it must have been alive</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.024" end="00:49:29.724" style="s2">when they were transferred.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.724" end="00:49:31.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then he did not die that night.</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.724" end="00:49:32.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This record proves only that he was</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.124" end="00:49:33.624" style="s2">taken away.</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.424" end="00:49:35.624" style="s2">It cannot tell us whether he still</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.624" end="00:49:38.124" style="s2">lives.</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.624" end="00:49:38.124" style="s2">Come this way.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.024" end="00:49:47.524" style="s2">I found it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.124" end="00:50:04.624" style="s2">The capital.</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.324" end="00:50:06.924" style="s2">There&#39;s a number after it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.624" end="00:50:08.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By order of the Crown. Open the door.</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.924" end="00:50:09.624" style="s2">We&#39;re here to collect the records.</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.524" end="00:50:11.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re here ahead of the appointed</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.624" end="00:50:11.924" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.069" end="00:50:14.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.924" end="00:50:14.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Archive eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.624" end="00:50:19.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave it sheathed.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.024" end="00:50:21.524" style="s2">Draw blood here and neither of us will</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.424" end="00:50:24.024" style="s2">leave this place. Stay hidden. Leave the</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.524" end="00:50:24.024" style="s2">rest to me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.124" end="00:50:31.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still searching through records at this</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.724" end="00:50:33.024" style="s2">hour.</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.524" end="00:50:35.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Crown&#39;s archives do not keep to</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.024" end="00:50:35.724" style="s2">ordinary hours.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.524" end="00:50:49.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The original records of the Eastern</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.824" end="00:50:52.624" style="s2">Marches incident. Pack every last one.</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.124" end="00:50:52.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sealed records are kept over there.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.824" end="00:51:03.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are Are here alone?</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.924" end="00:51:06.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mine is</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.225" end="00:51:06.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the only name on the duty register.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.525" end="00:51:29.015" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wagon axle has come loose. Someone</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.225" end="00:51:31.035" style="s2">give me a hand.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.015" end="00:51:31.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough and clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.125" end="00:51:34.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get these two chests outside.</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.825" end="00:51:43.625" style="s2">The Inner Court will count every record</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.325" end="00:51:45.725" style="s2">come morning.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.625" end="00:51:48.625" style="s2">If so much as a single page is missing,</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.725" end="00:51:51.125" style="s2">you will answer for it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.625" end="00:51:51.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.825" end="00:52:10.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lied to him.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.925" end="00:52:13.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.425" end="00:52:16.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.725" end="00:52:17.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I want to know why they are so</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.125" end="00:52:20.025" style="s2">afraid to leave even a single page from</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.825" end="00:52:22.025" style="s2">16 years ago untouched.</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.025" end="00:52:23.425" style="s2">The capital.</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.025" end="00:52:25.825" style="s2">It is the only trail we have left to</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.425" end="00:52:25.825" style="s2">follow.</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.125" end="00:52:30.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I shall go.</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.725" end="00:52:34.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll never get through the gates of</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.825" end="00:52:37.925" style="s2">the Inner City.</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.825" end="00:52:39.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I &#39;ll find another way in.</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.925" end="00:52:40.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You scarcely know your way around this</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.125" end="00:52:42.025" style="s2">city.</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.325" end="00:52:45.425" style="s2">The capital is no forest you can find</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.025" end="00:52:48.325" style="s2">your way through by instinct alone.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.425" end="00:52:50.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do you propose?</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.325" end="00:52:52.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a royal writ granting me access</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.025" end="00:52:53.525" style="s2">to the archives. It expires in a month&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.325" end="00:52:54.625" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.525" end="00:52:57.325" style="s2">And</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.625" end="00:53:00.225" style="s2">a horse with a rather foul temper.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.325" end="00:53:03.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with the horse?</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.225" end="00:53:03.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll find out tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.525" end="00:53:10.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father, no.</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.127" end="00:53:10.227" style="s2">Father, it&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.427" end="00:53:14.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t believe everything [music] written</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.527" end="00:53:14.227" style="s2">in stone,</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.527" end="00:53:17.827" style="s2">nor anything written on parchment, it</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.027" end="00:53:20.227" style="s2">seems.</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.827" end="00:53:22.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you&#39;d already left.</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.227" end="00:53:24.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.127" end="00:53:27.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s something I must ask you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.627" end="00:53:27.527" style="s2">Why did you help them?</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.327" end="00:53:33.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because they once saved my life.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.227" end="00:53:33.827" style="s2">They raised me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.027" end="00:53:38.827" style="s2">That is my home.</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.627" end="00:53:45.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come.</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.027" end="00:53:45.027" style="s2">Let me show you your horse.</p>
<p begin="00:53:58.627" end="00:54:01.727" style="s2">Are you truly a hunter?</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.227" end="00:54:07.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am.</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.927" end="00:54:10.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A hunter who cannot ride a horse?</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.227" end="00:54:10.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never said what I hunt.</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.027" end="00:54:15.227" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t like me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.127" end="00:54:15.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It treats everyone that way.</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.327" end="00:54:18.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It seems to have taken a particular</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.727" end="00:54:20.682" style="s2">dislike to me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.662" end="00:54:20.682" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.727" end="00:54:46.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And him?</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.027" end="00:54:48.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My escort.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.927" end="00:54:50.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Name?</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.127" end="00:54:51.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan.</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.227" end="00:54:54.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Family name?</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.827" end="00:54:54.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have none.</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.227" end="00:55:04.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve had a great many men without</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.727" end="00:55:07.627" style="s2">family names these past two days.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.427" end="00:55:08.128" style="s2">Have you ever seen this creature?</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.627" end="00:55:11.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never seen</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.128" end="00:55:11.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; drawn so poorly.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.428" end="00:55:15.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s a hunter from the woods. He&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.128" end="00:55:17.128" style="s2">accustomed to the ways of the city.</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.428" end="00:55:19.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The capital has tightened its watch of</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.128" end="00:55:19.928" style="s2">late. You vowed to</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.528" end="00:55:25.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God above.</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.928" end="00:55:32.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET THAT WRETCHED BEAST AWAY FROM ME.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.928" end="00:55:35.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; PERHAPS HE DOESN&#39;T take kindly to being</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.428" end="00:55:35.028" style="s2">questioned.</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.928" end="00:55:41.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GO. NOW BE ON YOUR WAY.</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.928" end="00:55:49.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NEXT TIME SOMEONE ASKS IF YOU&#39;VE SEEN</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.428" end="00:55:51.428" style="s2">SOMETHING, just say no.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.628" end="00:55:52.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He asked about the drawing.</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.428" end="00:55:55.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is not the place to take every</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.728" end="00:55:55.928" style="s2">question so literally.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.828" end="00:56:05.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Commander Calder requests a reassessment</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.628" end="00:56:07.228" style="s2">of the campaign in the eastern marches.</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.928" end="00:56:10.428" style="s2">He believes any further advance would</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.228" end="00:56:10.428" style="s2">cost us even more men.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.328" end="00:56:17.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is Calder?</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.728" end="00:56:19.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He is due to arrive tomorrow evening.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.128" end="00:56:19.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send him to me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.728" end="00:56:24.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shall we have them intercepted on the</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.928" end="00:56:27.128" style="s2">road?</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.628" end="00:56:28.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.128" end="00:56:30.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are they searching for?</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.928" end="00:56:33.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The royal transfer records from 16 years</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.928" end="00:56:33.228" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.428" end="00:56:40.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let them keep searching.</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.628" end="00:56:42.828" style="s2">See that their travel permits remain</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.228" end="00:56:42.828" style="s2">valid.</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.928" end="00:56:49.628" style="s2">Do not arouse his suspicion.</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.928" end="00:56:49.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my lord.</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.728" end="00:56:59.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.028" end="00:57:06.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are those? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.628" end="00:57:06.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The dragon keeps.</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.928" end="00:57:12.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Primordial.</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.529" end="00:57:16.129" style="s2">Beware of this.</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.529" end="00:57:18.529" style="s2">Until we meet again.</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.129" end="00:57:18.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan.</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.629" end="00:57:23.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m all right.</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.629" end="00:57:23.129" style="s2">Let&#39;s go in.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.339" end="00:57:27.359" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.929" end="00:57:36.029" style="s2">Elan, from the Border Branch.</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.429" end="00:57:38.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My permit is valid for another 27 days.</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.029" end="00:57:38.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who might this be?</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.629" end="00:57:42.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A temporary pauper and guard.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.029" end="00:57:47.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See that he&#39;s properly dressed.</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.129" end="00:57:47.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right away.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.529" end="00:57:55.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.629" end="00:57:57.229" style="s2">At least now you look like you belong</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.029" end="00:57:57.229" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.229" end="00:58:04.229" style="s2">Only authorized archivists may examine</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.129" end="00:58:06.129" style="s2">the sealed records.</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.229" end="00:58:08.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand. He&#39;s only here to carry</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.129" end="00:58:08.629" style="s2">the records.</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.029" end="00:58:15.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Return the key before dawn</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.729" end="00:58:17.329" style="s2">and see that nothing inside is</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.929" end="00:58:19.729" style="s2">disturbed.</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.329" end="00:58:19.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.829" end="00:58:30.329" style="s2">Right here.</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.329" end="00:58:37.229" style="s2">Someone has taken [music] it.</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.529" end="00:58:42.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Within the last three days.</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.829" end="00:58:44.729" style="s2">They knew we would come looking for it.</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.595" end="00:58:46.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.729" end="00:58:48.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If these were merely old records,</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.929" end="00:58:50.490" style="s2">they would never have been removed by</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.129" end="00:58:52.510" style="s2">royal order.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.490" end="00:58:52.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.029" end="00:59:00.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What use are these old scrolls anyway?</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.129" end="00:59:02.529" style="s2">The Office of Necromancy asked for them</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.629" end="00:59:04.529" style="s2">by name, and we&#39;re not even allowed to</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.529" end="00:59:08.329" style="s2">look inside the chests. Seeing what&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.529" end="00:59:08.329" style="s2">inside won&#39;t put bread on your table.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.829" end="00:59:12.129" style="s2">The Office of Necromancy.</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.529" end="00:59:17.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here in the capital, their orders are</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.231" end="00:59:20.331" style="s2">carried out faster than ours.</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.331" end="00:59:20.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then that&#39;s where we&#39;ll go.</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.131" end="00:59:26.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is not a place where you can simply</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.631" end="00:59:29.431" style="s2">present a rent and start turning pages.</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.431" end="00:59:29.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is always a way.</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.831" end="00:59:35.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you answer for this, commander?</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.131" end="00:59:37.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve already told your lackeys. I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.131" end="00:59:37.931" style="s2">repeat myself.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.531" end="00:59:44.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A stern voice will not make your failure</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.631" end="00:59:46.931" style="s2">disappear.</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.531" end="00:59:48.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw the man.</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.931" end="00:59:51.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.931" end="00:59:53.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the form of a man.</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.331" end="00:59:55.131" style="s2">At first.</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.231" end="00:59:58.331" style="s2">And then?</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.131" end="01:00:01.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do not know if what I saw was human.</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.331" end="01:00:02.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who did it protect?</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.031" end="01:00:05.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have time to waste answering</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.331" end="01:00:05.331" style="s2">your pointless questions.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.131" end="01:00:11.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you encountered him here in the</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.431" end="01:00:12.831" style="s2">capital, what would you do?</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.631" end="01:00:14.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First,</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.831" end="01:00:17.131" style="s2">I would learn whether he posed a threat</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.331" end="01:00:17.131" style="s2">to innocent people.</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.261" end="01:00:20.281" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.431" end="01:00:30.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The guards at the main gate change every</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.931" end="01:00:30.431" style="s2">half hour.</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.531" end="01:00:36.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the rear entrance?</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.031" end="01:00:37.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three wagons went in. Only two came out.</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.031" end="01:00:39.531" style="s2">But there&#39;s an old service that used to</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.531" end="01:00:42.131" style="s2">haul away waste. Only two guards are</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.531" end="01:00:42.131" style="s2">posted there.</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.131" end="01:00:45.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know?</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.431" end="01:00:51.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From someone I came to know while</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.731" end="01:00:51.731" style="s2">searching the archives.</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.131" end="01:00:56.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve drawn yourself into this now.</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.831" end="01:00:58.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.231" end="01:01:00.131" style="s2">There is something I must make clear.</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.431" end="01:01:02.431" style="s2">If we find Holt, I will help you bring</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.131" end="01:01:04.131" style="s2">him out. But if we find evidence of what</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.431" end="01:01:05.531" style="s2">they&#39;ve done, I&#39;m taking that with us,</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.131" end="01:01:08.531" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.531" end="01:01:10.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So long as you live to carry it out.</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.531" end="01:01:13.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So we don&#39;t go through the front.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.331" end="01:01:14.331" style="s2">We use the old service passage.</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.131" end="01:01:17.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.331" end="01:01:17.532" style="s2">Leave those two guards to me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.632" end="01:01:25.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Halt. Who are you?</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.532" end="01:01:26.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m from the Royal Archives. I&#39;ve come</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.532" end="01:01:30.132" style="s2">to inspect the records of goods</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.732" end="01:01:30.132" style="s2">transported through this old passage.</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.332" end="01:01:35.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This passage falls under the authority</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.932" end="01:01:37.432" style="s2">of the Office of Necromancy.</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.832" end="01:01:39.332" style="s2">Our authority stands above that of your</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.432" end="01:01:40.932" style="s2">archives. You have no right to</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.332" end="01:01:42.032" style="s2">investigate what passes through these</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.932" end="01:01:44.132" style="s2">doors.</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.032" end="01:01:45.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that so?</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.132" end="01:01:48.832" style="s2">Then have a look at this.</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.832" end="01:01:48.832" style="s2">Will this grant me leave?</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.432" end="01:01:58.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.832" end="01:01:58.232" style="s2">This is</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.432" end="01:02:04.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re stronger than you look.</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.932" end="01:02:08.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t grow up sparing with men.</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.032" end="01:02:23.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shouldn&#39;t we do something about these</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.332" end="01:02:26.832" style="s2">two?</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.932" end="01:02:26.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ll wake soon enough.</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.532" end="01:02:30.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you certain?</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.732" end="01:02:33.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I held back.</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.932" end="01:02:33.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How reassuring.</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.432" end="01:02:42.732" style="s2">They&#39;ve been moving things through here</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.632" end="01:02:44.332" style="s2">recently.</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.732" end="01:02:47.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can smell it.</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.332" end="01:02:47.032" style="s2">Monster blood.</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.428" end="01:02:59.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.628" end="01:03:25.648" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.133" end="01:03:37.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.033" end="01:03:40.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re doing something to them.</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.033" end="01:03:43.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen.</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.333" end="01:03:45.333" style="s2">If you rush in now, you won&#39;t even reach</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.733" end="01:03:46.433" style="s2">the first cage. There are royal guards</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.333" end="01:03:47.933" style="s2">below.</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.433" end="01:03:49.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can try.</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.933" end="01:03:50.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And then</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.033" end="01:03:52.833" style="s2">you&#39;ll reveal what you are.</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.833" end="01:03:54.633" style="s2">They&#39;ll seal every passage.</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.833" end="01:03:57.333" style="s2">Then you won&#39;t be able to save them</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.633" end="01:03:57.333" style="s2">nor your father.</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.733" end="01:04:01.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember this place.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.533" end="01:04:03.233" style="s2">I&#39;ll come back.</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.233" end="01:04:07.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will. If the old plans are right, the</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.233" end="01:04:07.033" style="s2">archive should be just ahead. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.733" end="01:04:21.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Commander, the Necrology Bureau has been</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.633" end="01:04:22.579" style="s2">breached. They request the royal guards&#39;</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.233" end="01:04:23.533" style="s2">aid.</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.579" end="01:04:26.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.533" end="01:04:26.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whose orders?</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.433" end="01:04:30.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Chief Necromagister.</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.533" end="01:04:31.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are the Bureau&#39;s guards not enough?</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.233" end="01:04:34.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Chief Necromagister has ordered the</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.333" end="01:04:34.233" style="s2">royal guard to join them.</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.433" end="01:04:38.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have my men secure the exits above</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.133" end="01:04:41.733" style="s2">and below.</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.733" end="01:04:43.533" style="s2">No one is to act without my command.</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.733" end="01:04:45.933" style="s2">And if we find the intruders</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.533" end="01:04:48.933" style="s2">first, I want to know who they are.</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.933" end="01:04:48.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Commander.</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.744" end="01:04:52.764" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.533" end="01:04:58.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.633" end="01:04:58.633" style="s2">you came after all.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.033" end="01:05:05.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 16 years ago,</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.733" end="01:05:07.933" style="s2">the Eastern Marges</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.633" end="01:05:10.133" style="s2">transferred by royal order</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.933" end="01:05:12.233" style="s2">halt.</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.133" end="01:05:15.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep looking.</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.233" end="01:05:17.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ninth level beneath the capital</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.333" end="01:05:19.235" style="s2">cell number 927</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.733" end="01:05:21.535" style="s2">not to be moved without the chief&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.235" end="01:05:21.535" style="s2">leave.</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.935" end="01:05:24.860" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:05:22.840" end="01:05:24.860" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.935" end="01:05:29.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Strange.</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.335" end="01:05:31.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.535" end="01:05:33.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are so many guards outside,</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.735" end="01:05:34.835" style="s2">yet in here there&#39;s hardly any watch at</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.235" end="01:05:37.235" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.835" end="01:05:39.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perhaps they&#39;re all in the hall.</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.235" end="01:05:39.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you all right?</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.435" end="01:05:45.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.935" end="01:05:46.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Truly?</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.035" end="01:05:48.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was just thinking,</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.935" end="01:05:52.335" style="s2">16 years.</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.835" end="01:05:52.335" style="s2">I don&#39;t know if he&#39;ll even recognize me.</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.835" end="01:05:59.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will recognize him. Let that be</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.735" end="01:05:59.135" style="s2">enough.</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.635" end="01:06:23.535" style="s2">9:21</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.535" end="01:06:26.435" style="s2">9:22</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.535" end="01:06:26.435" style="s2">9:23</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.735" end="01:06:35.735" style="s2">9:27</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.856" end="01:06:38.876" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.935" end="01:06:54.335" style="s2">Father?</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.535" end="01:07:07.935" style="s2">Riot.</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.435" end="01:07:20.335" style="s2">It&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.635" end="01:07:20.335" style="s2">I&#39;ve come back.</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.035" end="01:07:25.136" style="s2">I&#39;ve come to take you home.</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.136" end="01:07:33.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.336" end="01:07:34.936" style="s2">Run.</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.636" end="01:07:37.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.936" end="01:07:37.636" style="s2">Father, what did you</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.136" end="01:07:50.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.136" end="01:07:59.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well met, Primordial.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.536" end="01:08:34.636" style="s2">16 years</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.936" end="01:08:38.136" style="s2">and all this time</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.636" end="01:08:38.136" style="s2">he&#39;s wondered what became of you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.636" end="01:08:44.236" style="s2">That blade will keep you still</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.736" end="01:08:44.236" style="s2">for a while.</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.636" end="01:09:01.436" style="s2">Father?</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.036" end="01:09:01.436" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.436" end="01:09:09.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run.</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.036" end="01:09:13.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He said the same thing 16 years ago,</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.336" end="01:09:15.636" style="s2">didn&#39;t he?</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.536" end="01:09:19.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET HIM GO.</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.636" end="01:09:19.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S NOT YOUR BARGAIN to make.</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.336" end="01:09:25.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make me</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.636" end="01:09:27.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re worth more</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.237" end="01:09:30.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; alive.</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.538" end="01:09:30.737" style="s2">Don&#39;t make me regret the trouble.</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.538" end="01:09:44.938" style="s2">Hmm.</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.438" end="01:09:44.938" style="s2">Now things are getting interesting.</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.703" end="01:09:56.838" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.438" end="01:09:59.338" style="s2">Father, wake up.</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.838" end="01:09:59.338" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.493" end="01:10:08.938" style="s2">[music] You chose a poor place to die.</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.418" end="01:10:29.438" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.938" end="01:10:35.338" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.069" end="01:10:49.089" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.238" end="01:10:52.738" style="s2">Ryan.</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.928" end="01:10:57.538" style="s2">[gasps and panting]</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.338" end="01:10:59.438" style="s2">Who are you?</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.538" end="01:11:01.038" style="s2">No time to explain.</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.438" end="01:11:03.338" style="s2">Can you stand?</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.038" end="01:11:03.338" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.438" end="01:11:08.338" style="s2">Stay close to me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.738" end="01:11:22.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry.</p>
<p begin="01:11:31.339" end="01:11:36.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew that gate was there.</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.939" end="01:11:36.639" style="s2">Who are you?</p>
<p begin="01:11:55.339" end="01:11:57.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan?</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.239" end="01:12:00.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re awake.</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.739" end="01:12:06.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t move. You&#39;re hurt.</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.939" end="01:12:06.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I noticed.</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.039" end="01:12:12.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw what happened. Your father.</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.239" end="01:12:14.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t him.</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.039" end="01:12:17.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are you still alive?</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.139" end="01:12:17.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been wondering that myself.</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.739" end="01:12:23.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are we?</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.839" end="01:12:25.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An old bindery.</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.539" end="01:12:28.739" style="s2">Western edge of the capital.</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.939" end="01:12:28.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did we get here?</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.739" end="01:12:32.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We had help.</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.939" end="01:12:39.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is that?</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.739" end="01:12:39.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The reason we&#39;re not still down there.</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.839" end="01:12:43.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You brought us here?</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.139" end="01:12:46.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.739" end="01:12:46.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From the ninth level?</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.239" end="01:12:50.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Through the old royal service passages.</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.555" end="01:12:53.539" style="s2">[music] The guards were looking in the</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.739" end="01:12:53.539" style="s2">wrong places.</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.439" end="01:13:01.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I tried to stop.</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.539" end="01:13:06.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay, father.</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.039" end="01:13:06.339" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.439" end="01:13:09.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is he free of it?</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.639" end="01:13:10.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.739" end="01:13:12.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does that mean?</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.639" end="01:13:15.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever his hold of him is still there.</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.839" end="01:13:16.639" style="s2">I can keep it quiet. Nothing more.</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.239" end="01:13:18.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, father.</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.639" end="01:13:19.239" style="s2">I&#39;ll take you home. This will all be</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.439" end="01:13:20.239" style="s2">over soon.</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.239" end="01:13:22.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.239" end="01:13:24.039" style="s2">He&#39;ll come for me. He always does.</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.639" end="01:13:25.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then he&#39;ll have to come through me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.039" end="01:13:28.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save your strength.</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.639" end="01:13:28.139" style="s2">Both of you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.939" end="01:13:36.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You You haven&#39;t told us who you are.</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.440" end="01:13:39.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t sure you&#39;d remember me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.940" end="01:13:39.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.336" end="01:13:41.356" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:13:42.611" end="01:13:44.631" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.440" end="01:14:00.740" style="s2">Father?</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.740" end="01:14:02.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Eilan.</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.740" end="01:14:05.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.140" end="01:14:05.040" style="s2">No, that&#39;s not possible.</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.540" end="01:14:12.940" style="s2">They told me you were dead.</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.040" end="01:14:17.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.940" end="01:14:17.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There was a ROYAL SEAL. I SAW IT MYSELF.</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.340" end="01:14:23.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The seal was real.</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.221" end="01:14:26.540" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.940" end="01:14:28.340" style="s2">The death was a lie.</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.540" end="01:14:29.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All these years</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.340" end="01:14:30.140" style="s2">you were alive.</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.540" end="01:14:33.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.140" end="01:14:33.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why DIDN&#39;T YOU COME BACK?</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.140" end="01:14:40.040" style="s2">Where have you been?</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.740" end="01:14:47.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was never far away.</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.140" end="01:14:49.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And not once did you come to me. One</p>
<p begin="01:14:47.440" end="01:14:52.340" style="s2">word.</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.740" end="01:14:54.840" style="s2">YOU COULD HAVE SENT ME.</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.340" end="01:14:56.626" style="s2">DID YOU ONE WORD?</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.840" end="01:14:57.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I SPOKE against Morcan.</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.626" end="01:14:58.540" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.240" end="01:15:00.340" style="s2">I saw what he was doing beneath the</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.540" end="01:15:01.740" style="s2">city.</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.340" end="01:15:03.440" style="s2">Soon after the Crown called me a</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.740" end="01:15:05.640" style="s2">traitor.</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.440" end="01:15:07.940" style="s2">The day they tried to execute me</p>
<p begin="01:15:05.640" end="01:15:10.240" style="s2">something in these eyes awakened.</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.940" end="01:15:13.540" style="s2">I didn&#39;t even know I had it.</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.240" end="01:15:15.622" style="s2">But somehow it saved my life.</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.540" end="01:15:18.740" style="s2">Everyone believed I was dead.</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.622" end="01:15:21.740" style="s2">[laughter] I had to let them.</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.740" end="01:15:23.540" style="s2">I wanted to come back for you</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.740" end="01:15:24.840" style="s2">every day.</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.540" end="01:15:27.840" style="s2">But if they found me, they would have</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.840" end="01:15:27.840" style="s2">come for you next.</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.997" end="01:15:34.017" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.940" end="01:15:37.542" style="s2">Where they?</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.742" end="01:15:41.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone got them out.</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.342" end="01:15:43.542" style="s2">Someone.</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.042" end="01:15:43.542" style="s2">One man.</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.642" end="01:15:48.742" style="s2">One man walked four prisoners out of the</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.942" end="01:15:48.742" style="s2">ninth level.</p>
<p begin="01:15:50.642" end="01:15:54.942" style="s2">And you couldn&#39;t stop him.</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.742" end="01:15:57.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He knew the old royal passages.</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.942" end="01:15:58.442" style="s2">And he saw my spell before it struck.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.242" end="01:16:00.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saw it.</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.442" end="01:16:02.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not sensed.</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.742" end="01:16:04.042" style="s2">Saw.</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.042" end="01:16:06.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring me the royal death rolls from 16</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.042" end="01:16:09.142" style="s2">years ago, every name without a body.</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.742" end="01:16:12.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my lord.</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.142" end="01:16:14.142" style="s2">Shall we halt the search in the city?</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.142" end="01:16:16.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.142" end="01:16:19.842" style="s2">Let it continue.</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.142" end="01:16:19.842" style="s2">Ryan is to be taken alive.</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.742" end="01:16:24.142" style="s2">The man who freed him, I want him</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.742" end="01:16:27.342" style="s2">breathing too.</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.142" end="01:16:27.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my lord.</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.942" end="01:16:36.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your hands.</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.742" end="01:16:38.942" style="s2">They&#39;re a man&#39;s hands now.</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.242" end="01:16:38.942" style="s2">It&#39;s been a while.</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.942" end="01:16:43.542" style="s2">That night</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.542" end="01:16:51.742" style="s2">I remember the axe.</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.942" end="01:16:55.342" style="s2">I remember you running.</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.742" end="01:16:55.342" style="s2">I remember trying to let go.</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.642" end="01:16:58.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For years I thought you meant to kill</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.042" end="01:17:00.942" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.542" end="01:17:04.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.942" end="01:17:04.142" style="s2">But I don&#39;t believe that anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.742" end="01:17:09.942" style="s2">And now I&#39;ve put a knife in you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.242" end="01:17:09.942" style="s2">That wasn&#39;t you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:10.042" end="01:17:13.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was my hand.</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.942" end="01:17:15.542" style="s2">You told me to run.</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.742" end="01:17:18.742" style="s2">Both times.</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.542" end="01:17:18.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not leaving you behind again.</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.342" end="01:17:35.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every house,</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.842" end="01:17:39.343" style="s2">EVERY CELLAR.</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.543" end="01:17:39.343" style="s2">LEAVE NOTHING UNCHECKED.</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.143" end="01:17:42.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OH, JOSH.</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.203" end="01:17:52.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.343" end="01:17:59.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THEY&#39;RE searching the houses now.</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.443" end="01:18:01.943" style="s2">Then we leave tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.343" end="01:18:04.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan can barely stand.</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.943" end="01:18:04.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can walk.</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.643" end="01:18:12.343" style="s2">The South Road is shut.</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.543" end="01:18:15.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Border Road?</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.343" end="01:18:17.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It won&#39;t stay open for long.</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.543" end="01:18:20.043" style="s2">West then.</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.143" end="01:18:23.143" style="s2">There&#39;s hardly a road to the west.</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.043" end="01:18:23.143" style="s2">Fewer men to stop us.</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.743" end="01:18:27.543" style="s2">You&#39;ll find me</p>
<p begin="01:18:27.943" end="01:18:34.643" style="s2">as long as this mark is here.</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.443" end="01:18:34.643" style="s2">You know where I am going.</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.743" end="01:18:40.843" style="s2">Then we must leave at once.</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.243" end="01:18:46.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s an old flood culvert west of the</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.943" end="01:18:47.443" style="s2">walls.</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.243" end="01:18:49.809" style="s2">We can reach it before the watch</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.443" end="01:18:51.829" style="s2">changes.</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.809" end="01:18:51.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:18:54.543" end="01:18:57.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They weren&#39;t supposed to be here.</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.543" end="01:19:03.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve sealed the crossings.</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.143" end="01:19:05.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we find another way.</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.543" end="01:19:07.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If they&#39;ve posted men here, the main</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.443" end="01:19:08.743" style="s2">roads will be crawling with them.</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.443" end="01:19:10.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six men.</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.743" end="01:19:12.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six we can see.</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.543" end="01:19:14.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t need to fight them.</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.443" end="01:19:16.843" style="s2">Cover your faces, both of you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.443" end="01:19:19.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And tell them what?</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.843" end="01:19:19.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That you&#39;re sick. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.543" end="01:19:23.343" style="s2">Very sick.</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.343" end="01:19:27.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You seem rather pleased with this.</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.943" end="01:19:28.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my servants. You have the pox.</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.943" end="01:19:31.043" style="s2">I&#39;m taking you out of the city before</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.943" end="01:19:34.543" style="s2">you infect the rest of my household.</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.043" end="01:19:34.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I serve as your guard.</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.743" end="01:19:38.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.543" end="01:19:41.644" style="s2">Don&#39;t speak unless they address you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.945" end="01:19:41.644" style="s2">Let me handle it.</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.545" end="01:19:50.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Halt. State your business.</p>
<p begin="01:19:48.344" end="01:19:51.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m leaving the city. Is that going to</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.045" end="01:19:53.644" style="s2">be a problem?</p>
<p begin="01:19:51.945" end="01:19:56.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Passage is restricted tonight, my lady.</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.644" end="01:19:59.144" style="s2">Captain&#39;s orders.</p>
<p begin="01:19:56.144" end="01:19:59.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with those two?</p>
<p begin="01:20:03.045" end="01:20:06.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The pox. Both of them.</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.244" end="01:20:10.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why bring them here?</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.445" end="01:20:12.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I won&#39;t have them dying in my</p>
<p begin="01:20:10.744" end="01:20:14.644" style="s2">house. They&#39;re being taken to our estate</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.744" end="01:20:16.344" style="s2">beyond the walls.</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.644" end="01:20:19.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take off their wrappings.</p>
<p begin="01:20:16.344" end="01:20:19.045" style="s2">I want to look at them.</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.130" end="01:20:28.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.945" end="01:20:32.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want them to uncover their faces?</p>
<p begin="01:20:28.344" end="01:20:32.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to know who&#39;s passing through.</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.645" end="01:20:34.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.945" end="01:20:36.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on then.</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.144" end="01:20:36.545" style="s2">Show him.</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.435" end="01:20:46.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.844" end="01:20:52.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow.</p>
<p begin="01:20:50.945" end="01:20:54.970" style="s2">No, leave it on.</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.950" end="01:20:54.970" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.545" end="01:21:01.344" style="s2">Are we quite finished?</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.445" end="01:21:04.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them through [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:21:01.344" end="01:21:04.945" style="s2">and keep those two away from the men.</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.344" end="01:21:28.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no.</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.945" end="01:21:33.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE STONE IS LIT. SEIZE THEM!</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.445" end="01:21:34.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LOOK AT ME, FATHER. Look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.945" end="01:21:37.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan.</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.744" end="01:21:37.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got him.</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.644" end="01:21:40.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s them. They&#39;re the ones the Arch</p>
<p begin="01:21:39.344" end="01:21:43.441" style="s2">NECROMANCER WANTS.</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.745" end="01:21:43.441" style="s2">SEIZE THEM! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.971" end="01:21:49.991" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.486" end="01:21:59.816" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.046" end="01:21:59.816" style="s2">SOUND THE HORN, NOW! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:22:03.691" end="01:22:05.711" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:22:10.046" end="01:22:14.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT&#39;S OKAY. HOLD.</p>
<p begin="01:22:12.845" end="01:22:14.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FATHER?</p>
<p begin="01:22:14.172" end="01:22:16.446" style="s2">[panting and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:22:14.946" end="01:22:18.745" style="s2">WAKE UP.</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.446" end="01:22:23.345" style="s2">RYAN.</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.745" end="01:22:23.345" style="s2">ELENE, RYAN, we&#39;re out of time. Move.</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.306" end="01:22:27.326" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.845" end="01:22:36.345" style="s2">At last.</p>
<p begin="01:22:33.546" end="01:22:36.345" style="s2">I&#39;ve caught you.</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.446" end="01:22:40.372" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here.</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.446" end="01:22:42.392" style="s2">Just a little</p>
<p begin="01:22:40.372" end="01:22:42.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:22:47.845" end="01:22:50.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father?</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.345" end="01:22:56.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="01:22:54.845" end="01:22:58.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who?</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.845" end="01:23:00.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morkin.</p>
<p begin="01:22:58.712" end="01:23:02.646" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:23:00.546" end="01:23:04.245" style="s2">It isn&#39;t another stone.</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.646" end="01:23:08.146" style="s2">It&#39;s him.</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.245" end="01:23:08.146" style="s2">He&#39;s close enough to take hold himself.</p>
<p begin="01:23:08.546" end="01:23:11.345" style="s2">Look at me. You&#39;re not in that cell</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.345" end="01:23:14.546" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:23:11.345" end="01:23:14.546" style="s2">We&#39;re almost at the forest.</p>
<p begin="01:23:15.146" end="01:23:19.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why can&#39;t I stop my hands?</p>
<p begin="01:23:17.046" end="01:23:19.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold him still.</p>
<p begin="01:23:20.982" end="01:23:23.345" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.046" end="01:23:26.345" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.345" end="01:23:26.345" style="s2">I won&#39;t let him take you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.046" end="01:23:38.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you all right?</p>
<p begin="01:23:37.146" end="01:23:39.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.046" end="01:23:41.946" style="s2">But I can no longer resist Morkin&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:23:39.546" end="01:23:41.946" style="s2">control.</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.347" end="01:23:48.547" style="s2">Ryan,</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.647" end="01:23:49.447" style="s2">kill [snorts] me.</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.547" end="01:23:50.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:23:49.447" end="01:23:51.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.347" end="01:23:54.347" style="s2">use me again.</p>
<p begin="01:23:51.947" end="01:23:54.347" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="01:23:54.747" end="01:23:58.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not losing you to him.</p>
<p begin="01:24:00.147" end="01:24:03.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Halt. Listen to me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.868" end="01:24:07.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.523" end="01:24:07.543" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.447" end="01:24:14.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run.</p>
<p begin="01:24:12.547" end="01:24:15.047" style="s2">Run. Run.</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.347" end="01:24:15.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Halt.</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.047" end="01:24:16.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run. Run.</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.947" end="01:24:16.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Halt.</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.647" end="01:24:18.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run.</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.947" end="01:24:21.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Eileen. Can you hear me?</p>
<p begin="01:24:18.547" end="01:24:22.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run. Run. Run.</p>
<p begin="01:24:21.047" end="01:24:24.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Halt.</p>
<p begin="01:24:22.347" end="01:24:24.847" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.047" end="01:24:29.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run. YOU HAVE TO RUN.</p>
<p begin="01:24:27.347" end="01:24:31.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HALT. LISTEN TO ME.</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.647" end="01:24:33.347" style="s2">NO one&#39;s going to hurt you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.747" end="01:24:34.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s still here.</p>
<p begin="01:24:33.347" end="01:24:36.308" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is?</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.647" end="01:24:38.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He never leaves.</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.308" end="01:24:38.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.047" end="01:24:45.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.347" end="01:24:47.443" style="s2">I&#39;ve tried for 16 years.</p>
<p begin="01:24:45.847" end="01:24:49.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let me try.</p>
<p begin="01:24:47.443" end="01:24:49.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:24:59.847" end="01:25:03.873" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. No.</p>
<p begin="01:25:01.853" end="01:25:03.873" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:25:06.247" end="01:25:09.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s only one way.</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.047" end="01:25:13.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BEHIND YOU!</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.678" end="01:25:13.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:25:26.847" end="01:25:30.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; EILEEN.</p>
<p begin="01:25:28.847" end="01:25:34.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RYAN, I CAN&#39;T I CAN&#39;T SEE YOU.</p>
<p begin="01:25:30.847" end="01:25:34.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BREATHE, EILEEN. I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="01:25:39.947" end="01:25:42.347" style="s2">Ryan.</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.774" end="01:25:47.849" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:25:45.347" end="01:25:47.849" style="s2">It&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="01:26:22.049" end="01:26:26.249" style="s2">The prisoner is free of you.</p>
<p begin="01:26:24.749" end="01:26:27.749" style="s2">I can see that.</p>
<p begin="01:26:26.249" end="01:26:30.649" style="s2">Alive.</p>
<p begin="01:26:27.749" end="01:26:30.649" style="s2">All four of them.</p>
<p begin="01:26:37.948" end="01:26:42.549" style="s2">Stay with Ellie.</p>
<p begin="01:26:39.649" end="01:26:42.549" style="s2">You can&#39;t stop them.</p>
<p begin="01:27:06.149" end="01:27:10.649" style="s2">Why the guards?</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.149" end="01:27:10.649" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.948" end="01:27:13.749" style="s2">The primordial.</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.820" end="01:27:16.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:27:17.049" end="01:27:20.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s what he is.</p>
<p begin="01:27:19.749" end="01:27:22.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.948" end="01:27:25.749" style="s2">It&#39;s him.</p>
<p begin="01:27:22.649" end="01:27:25.749" style="s2">Let him try this.</p>
<p begin="01:27:38.400" end="01:27:40.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:27:55.150" end="01:27:58.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="01:27:56.750" end="01:28:01.350" style="s2">You&#39;ll never reach him.</p>
<p begin="01:27:58.350" end="01:28:01.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S MY SON.</p>
<p begin="01:28:01.650" end="01:28:04.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:28:04.600" end="01:28:06.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:28:11.805" end="01:28:13.825" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:28:54.381" end="01:28:56.401" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:28:59.621" end="01:29:01.641" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.250" end="01:29:06.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can see.</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.950" end="01:29:08.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your eye.</p>
<p begin="01:29:06.350" end="01:29:10.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s healed.</p>
<p begin="01:29:08.750" end="01:29:12.950" style="s2">Thank you, little one.</p>
<p begin="01:29:10.750" end="01:29:16.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not disappoint me, Vyrce.</p>
<p begin="01:29:12.950" end="01:29:16.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my lord.</p>
<p begin="01:29:20.450" end="01:29:23.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rise.</p>
<p begin="01:29:33.950" end="01:29:37.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got to be kidding me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.642" end="01:29:56.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:29:57.451" end="01:30:00.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look terrible, boy.</p>
<p begin="01:29:59.882" end="01:30:03.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.751" end="01:30:06.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good to see you, too.</p>
<p begin="01:30:03.351" end="01:30:08.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you still fight?</p>
<p begin="01:30:06.351" end="01:30:08.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try me.</p>
<p begin="01:30:12.151" end="01:30:15.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay with Holt.</p>
<p begin="01:30:14.052" end="01:30:18.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you going?</p>
<p begin="01:30:15.451" end="01:30:18.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To settle something.</p>
<p begin="01:30:35.552" end="01:30:39.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You again.</p>
<p begin="01:30:37.872" end="01:30:39.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:30:41.052" end="01:30:47.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should have stayed in that dungeon.</p>
<p begin="01:30:43.951" end="01:30:47.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should have stayed dead.</p>
<p begin="01:30:56.867" end="01:30:58.887" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:31:04.073" end="01:31:06.093" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:31:08.651" end="01:31:13.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it.</p>
<p begin="01:31:09.751" end="01:31:13.251" style="s2">The human army is here, too.</p>
<p begin="01:31:22.413" end="01:31:24.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.052" end="01:31:32.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan, listen to me. This army won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:31:30.451" end="01:31:34.851" style="s2">stop. Not while Morken still draws power</p>
<p begin="01:31:32.751" end="01:31:36.951" style="s2">from that place. What place? Beneath the</p>
<p begin="01:31:34.851" end="01:31:39.151" style="s2">ninth level. The heart of his power lies</p>
<p begin="01:31:36.951" end="01:31:40.951" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="01:31:39.151" end="01:31:42.063" style="s2">Break the source and you break his hold</p>
<p begin="01:31:40.951" end="01:31:43.451" style="s2">on this army.</p>
<p begin="01:31:42.063" end="01:31:45.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:31:43.451" end="01:31:47.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I have to go back.</p>
<p begin="01:31:45.351" end="01:31:49.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take the girl.</p>
<p begin="01:31:47.351" end="01:31:50.578" style="s2">Her eyes may be the only way through his</p>
<p begin="01:31:49.151" end="01:31:52.598" style="s2">sorcery.</p>
<p begin="01:31:50.578" end="01:31:52.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:31:54.508" end="01:31:56.528" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:32:04.952" end="01:32:09.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you truly think I wouldn&#39;t see you?</p>
<p begin="01:32:11.538" end="01:32:13.558" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:32:30.752" end="01:32:33.552" style="s2">Enough.</p>
<p begin="01:32:34.464" end="01:32:36.484" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:32:42.323" end="01:32:44.344" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:33:23.852" end="01:33:30.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What in the god&#39;s name IS HE DOING?</p>
<p begin="01:33:26.052" end="01:33:30.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COMMANDER, OUR MEN ARE STILL OUT THERE.</p>
<p begin="01:33:37.153" end="01:33:39.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COME HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:33:51.099" end="01:33:53.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:33:54.552" end="01:33:57.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET THE CLEAR. NOW!</p>
<p begin="01:34:09.354" end="01:34:12.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ELLEN, WE HAVE TO GO BACK.</p>
<p begin="01:34:11.154" end="01:34:14.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TO THE CAPITAL?</p>
<p begin="01:34:12.754" end="01:34:16.645" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE SOURCE of his power is beneath the</p>
<p begin="01:34:14.254" end="01:34:17.354" style="s2">ninth level.</p>
<p begin="01:34:16.645" end="01:34:19.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:34:17.354" end="01:34:19.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The chamber beneath the prison. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:34:19.154" end="01:34:21.154" style="s2">coming with you.</p>
<p begin="01:34:19.854" end="01:34:22.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan, wait.</p>
<p begin="01:34:21.154" end="01:34:26.354" style="s2">The fire isn&#39;t the only thing down</p>
<p begin="01:34:22.454" end="01:34:28.854" style="s2">there. Find what lies beneath it.</p>
<p begin="01:34:26.354" end="01:34:28.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="01:34:30.400" end="01:34:34.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.154" end="01:34:34.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready?</p>
<p begin="01:34:34.154" end="01:34:37.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:34:34.954" end="01:34:37.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s finish this.</p>
<p begin="01:34:41.954" end="01:34:44.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MORTALS!</p>
<p begin="01:34:42.845" end="01:34:44.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:34:50.054" end="01:34:54.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CALL IT OFF. OUR MEN ARE DYING.</p>
<p begin="01:34:52.454" end="01:34:58.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THEN keep them out of my way.</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.254" end="01:34:58.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those men SERVE THE CROWN, NOT YOU.</p>
<p begin="01:34:59.220" end="01:35:03.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:34:59.954" end="01:35:03.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And yet here you stand.</p>
<p begin="01:35:03.754" end="01:35:05.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was ordered to lead the royal army to</p>
<p begin="01:35:05.254" end="01:35:07.354" style="s2">your aid.</p>
<p begin="01:35:05.954" end="01:35:07.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can nothing for the lives of our</p>
<p begin="01:35:07.354" end="01:35:10.154" style="s2">men.</p>
<p begin="01:35:07.954" end="01:35:12.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is none of your concern. This ends</p>
<p begin="01:35:10.154" end="01:35:12.554" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:35:15.595" end="01:35:17.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:35:27.354" end="01:35:31.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ask too many [music] questions.</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.054" end="01:35:34.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are a</p>
<p begin="01:35:31.554" end="01:35:34.254" style="s2">monster.</p>
<p begin="01:35:45.071" end="01:35:47.091" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:35:58.354" end="01:36:01.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Going somewhere?</p>
<p begin="01:36:01.446" end="01:36:04.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:36:01.756" end="01:36:06.756" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s my father?</p>
<p begin="01:36:04.555" end="01:36:09.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He put up quite a fight.</p>
<p begin="01:36:06.756" end="01:36:12.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I asked you where he is.</p>
<p begin="01:36:09.955" end="01:36:15.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last I saw him, he was on the ground.</p>
<p begin="01:36:12.455" end="01:36:15.656" style="s2">Still breathing, I believe.</p>
<p begin="01:36:21.055" end="01:36:24.356" style="s2">Get off the horses.</p>
<p begin="01:36:22.955" end="01:36:26.156" style="s2">Both of you.</p>
<p begin="01:36:24.356" end="01:36:28.156" style="s2">Go. [music] Get to the ninth level.</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.156" end="01:36:30.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? No.</p>
<p begin="01:36:28.156" end="01:36:33.756" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll deal with him.</p>
<p begin="01:36:30.256" end="01:36:33.756" style="s2">You know what happens if we fail.</p>
<p begin="01:36:35.756" end="01:36:38.756" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t get yourself killed.</p>
<p begin="01:36:39.856" end="01:36:42.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll try not to.</p>
<p begin="01:36:50.256" end="01:36:52.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go.</p>
<p begin="01:37:07.356" end="01:37:10.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So be it.</p>
<p begin="01:37:21.455" end="01:37:26.656" style="s2">All that strength, and you still don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:37:23.656" end="01:37:26.656" style="s2">know how to use it.</p>
<p begin="01:37:42.317" end="01:37:44.337" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:37:52.756" end="01:37:57.555" style="s2">What are you?</p>
<p begin="01:37:54.656" end="01:37:59.955" style="s2">The one you couldn&#39;t kill.</p>
<p begin="01:37:57.555" end="01:38:01.156" style="s2">You think killing me will stop him?</p>
<p begin="01:37:59.955" end="01:38:03.556" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="01:38:01.156" end="01:38:05.957" style="s2">But it&#39;s A START.</p>
<p begin="01:38:03.556" end="01:38:05.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO!</p>
<p begin="01:38:32.857" end="01:38:38.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IF I DESTROY THAT,</p>
<p begin="01:38:35.556" end="01:38:38.156" style="s2">WILL IT END?</p>
<p begin="01:38:44.556" end="01:38:46.857" style="s2">NO.</p>
<p begin="01:38:47.556" end="01:38:51.056" style="s2">They&#39;re all dead.</p>
<p begin="01:38:49.556" end="01:38:53.757" style="s2">Every one of them.</p>
<p begin="01:38:51.056" end="01:38:56.556" style="s2">Then why is the fire still burning</p>
<p begin="01:38:53.757" end="01:38:56.556" style="s2">beneath the fire?</p>
<p begin="01:38:57.257" end="01:39:01.457" style="s2">Unless</p>
<p begin="01:38:58.556" end="01:39:01.457" style="s2">this isn&#39;t the source.</p>
<p begin="01:39:18.457" end="01:39:20.957" style="s2">There you are.</p>
<p begin="01:39:31.957" end="01:39:34.757" style="s2">God help us.</p>
<p begin="01:39:34.978" end="01:39:36.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:39:42.839" end="01:39:44.859" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:40:08.858" end="01:40:11.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re still here.</p>
<p begin="01:40:11.758" end="01:40:16.358" style="s2">He took their lives</p>
<p begin="01:40:14.158" end="01:40:18.858" style="s2">and kept their souls.</p>
<p begin="01:40:16.358" end="01:40:18.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elen.</p>
<p begin="01:40:19.458" end="01:40:22.758" style="s2">What is this place?</p>
<p begin="01:40:20.658" end="01:40:23.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan, how did you find this place? Where</p>
<p begin="01:40:22.758" end="01:40:25.158" style="s2">is Vess?</p>
<p begin="01:40:23.658" end="01:40:27.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I followed the passage beneath the holy</p>
<p begin="01:40:25.158" end="01:40:30.058" style="s2">fire.</p>
<p begin="01:40:27.458" end="01:40:31.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vess is dead.</p>
<p begin="01:40:30.058" end="01:40:34.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You killed him.</p>
<p begin="01:40:31.658" end="01:40:37.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He won&#39;t hurt anyone again.</p>
<p begin="01:40:34.158" end="01:40:37.058" style="s2">What is that thing?</p>
<p begin="01:40:38.258" end="01:40:41.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The source of the holy fire.</p>
<p begin="01:40:43.358" end="01:40:48.358" style="s2">Ryan, wait.</p>
<p begin="01:40:45.158" end="01:40:48.358" style="s2">We can&#39;t just destroy it.</p>
<p begin="01:40:49.158" end="01:40:54.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why not?</p>
<p begin="01:40:51.658" end="01:40:55.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Their souls are still trapped inside.</p>
<p begin="01:40:54.258" end="01:40:57.758" style="s2">If we break the heart now, we&#39;ll destroy</p>
<p begin="01:40:55.758" end="01:41:00.058" style="s2">what&#39;s left of them.</p>
<p begin="01:40:57.758" end="01:41:01.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you free them?</p>
<p begin="01:41:00.058" end="01:41:03.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think so.</p>
<p begin="01:41:01.958" end="01:41:05.858" style="s2">I broke Holt&#39;s chains. These must have a</p>
<p begin="01:41:03.758" end="01:41:07.958" style="s2">weakness, too.</p>
<p begin="01:41:05.858" end="01:41:11.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then find it.</p>
<p begin="01:41:07.958" end="01:41:11.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am afraid I can&#39;t allow that.</p>
<p begin="01:41:15.058" end="01:41:21.058" style="s2">Ryan,</p>
<p begin="01:41:16.858" end="01:41:21.058" style="s2">so the old blood has finally awakened.</p>
<p begin="01:41:21.558" end="01:41:25.074" style="s2">You did all this. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:41:25.658" end="01:41:29.358" style="s2">Every bit of it.</p>
<p begin="01:41:27.640" end="01:41:32.758" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:41:29.358" end="01:41:32.758" style="s2">You&#39;re going to pay for this.</p>
<p begin="01:41:33.158" end="01:41:36.258" style="s2">Then come and make me.</p>
<p begin="01:41:46.635" end="01:41:50.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:41:47.258" end="01:41:50.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You deal with THAT HEART.</p>
<p begin="01:41:59.058" end="01:42:02.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ELEN, NOW.</p>
<p begin="01:42:12.180" end="01:42:14.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:42:21.350" end="01:42:23.370" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:42:41.959" end="01:42:46.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;VE BROKEN ONE BEFORE.</p>
<p begin="01:42:44.359" end="01:42:46.950" style="s2">I CAN DO it again. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:42:48.659" end="01:42:51.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re all dead.</p>
<p begin="01:42:51.959" end="01:42:56.059" style="s2">With on the voice, stop it.</p>
<p begin="01:43:02.759" end="01:43:05.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll have to get through me.</p>
<p begin="01:43:06.659" end="01:43:09.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gladly.</p>
<p begin="01:43:31.659" end="01:43:34.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on.</p>
<p begin="01:43:37.259" end="01:43:39.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:43:44.559" end="01:43:48.659" style="s2">I can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:43:45.959" end="01:43:48.659" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:43:56.326" end="01:43:58.346" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:44:19.252" end="01:44:21.272" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:44:34.972" end="01:44:36.992" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:44:45.452" end="01:44:47.472" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:44:56.861" end="01:44:59.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What has she done?</p>
<p begin="01:45:00.361" end="01:45:02.761" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="01:45:03.861" end="01:45:07.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ryan,</p>
<p begin="01:45:05.261" end="01:45:09.661" style="s2">the chains,</p>
<p begin="01:45:07.061" end="01:45:09.661" style="s2">they&#39;re broken.</p>
<p begin="01:45:11.161" end="01:45:13.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aelin,</p>
<p begin="01:45:16.238" end="01:45:19.561" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:45:17.061" end="01:45:19.561" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:45:21.477" end="01:45:23.497" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:45:25.361" end="01:45:28.461" style="s2">It&#39;s over, Morath.</p>
<p begin="01:45:34.261" end="01:45:39.461" style="s2">Without that heart, the fire dies. Your</p>
<p begin="01:45:36.961" end="01:45:42.961" style="s2">kingdom will be left in darkness.</p>
<p begin="01:45:39.461" end="01:45:42.961" style="s2">Then they&#39;ll have to find another way.</p>
<p begin="01:45:46.861" end="01:45:49.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No!</p>
<p begin="01:45:47.677" end="01:45:49.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:46:00.123" end="01:46:05.261" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:46:01.361" end="01:46:05.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t know what you&#39;ve undone.</p>
<p begin="01:46:14.461" end="01:46:19.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two years ago,</p>
<p begin="01:46:16.162" end="01:46:21.863" style="s2">we stood on the edge of extinction.</p>
<p begin="01:46:19.863" end="01:46:23.762" style="s2">We lost warriors,</p>
<p begin="01:46:21.863" end="01:46:25.662" style="s2">we lost friends,</p>
<p begin="01:46:23.762" end="01:46:27.962" style="s2">we lost those who never had the chance</p>
<p begin="01:46:25.662" end="01:46:30.262" style="s2">to come home.</p>
<p begin="01:46:27.962" end="01:46:31.962" style="s2">For generations, we were taught to fear</p>
<p begin="01:46:30.262" end="01:46:35.162" style="s2">mankind,</p>
<p begin="01:46:31.962" end="01:46:38.162" style="s2">and mankind was taught to fear us.</p>
<p begin="01:46:35.162" end="01:46:40.662" style="s2">But when darkness came, it was not blood</p>
<p begin="01:46:38.162" end="01:46:41.762" style="s2">or birth that decided who stood beside</p>
<p begin="01:46:40.662" end="01:46:44.062" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="01:46:41.762" end="01:46:46.662" style="s2">It was the choices we made.</p>
<p begin="01:46:44.062" end="01:46:48.962" style="s2">The war is over,</p>
<p begin="01:46:46.662" end="01:46:50.662" style="s2">but peace is not something we win in a</p>
<p begin="01:46:48.962" end="01:46:53.662" style="s2">single battle.</p>
<p begin="01:46:50.662" end="01:46:55.363" style="s2">It is something we must choose day after</p>
<p begin="01:46:53.662" end="01:46:58.863" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="01:46:55.363" end="01:47:01.662" style="s2">And so, on this day of return, let us</p>
<p begin="01:46:58.863" end="01:47:03.863" style="s2">remember those we have lost</p>
<p begin="01:47:01.662" end="01:47:06.562" style="s2">and welcome those who have found their</p>
<p begin="01:47:03.863" end="01:47:06.562" style="s2">way home.</p>
<p begin="01:47:12.562" end="01:47:18.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He seems happy here.</p>
<p begin="01:47:15.062" end="01:47:18.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s always been trouble.</p>
<p begin="01:47:19.162" end="01:47:24.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sounds like my son.</p>
<p begin="01:47:21.999" end="01:47:24.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:47:26.584" end="01:47:31.162" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:47:27.962" end="01:47:31.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this how you imagined it?</p>
<p begin="01:47:33.162" end="01:47:36.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never thought we&#39;d get this far.</p>
<p begin="01:47:37.064" end="01:47:39.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:47:37.363" end="01:47:39.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But we did.</p>
<p begin="01:47:46.889" end="01:47:48.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:47:52.129" end="01:47:54.149" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:48:00.644" end="01:48:02.664" style="s2">[music]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
